It's 30+ years since my mom left this earth, and 40+ years since I lived in a house with a basement. I've lived, studied and worked in NYC, TO, Ottawa and my natal Winnipeg. I've travelled to six European countries (not including your beloved Poland), many US cities, and Israel.
